sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as ProximaDB::new
    participant SS as SharedServices
    participant CS as CollectionService  
    participant DVS as DirectVectorService
    participant SE as StorageEngine
    participant MS as MultiServer
    
    Note over Main: 🚀 Clean Initialization (No Circular Dependencies)
    
    Main->>Main: 1. Create MetricsCollector
    
    Main->>SS: 2. Create SharedServices FIRST
    activate SS
    SS->>CS: Create CollectionService
    activate CS
    CS-->>SS: CollectionService instance
    deactivate CS
    
    SS->>DVS: Create DirectVectorService
    activate DVS
    DVS-->>SS: DirectVectorService instance
    deactivate DVS
    
    SS-->>Main: Return (SharedServices, CollectionService)
    deactivate SS
    
    Note over Main,SS: ✅ SharedServices owns all services
    
    Main->>SE: 3. Create StorageEngine
    activate SE
    Main->>SE: Inject CollectionService from SharedServices
    SE-->>Main: StorageEngine instance
    deactivate SE
    
    Note over Main,SE: ✅ No duplicate CollectionService creation
    
    Main->>Main: 4. ProximaDB::start()
    
    Main->>SE: Start StorageEngine
    activate SE
    SE->>SE: Recover collections from metadata snapshots
    SE-->>Main: Collections recovered
    deactivate SE
    
    Note over SE: 📦 Collections Recovery Complete
    
    Main->>SS: 5. Recover assignments (future)
    activate SS
    SS-->>Main: Assignments recovered
    deactivate SS
    
    Note over SS: 🗺️ Assignment Recovery Complete
    
    Main->>SS: 6. Recover vectors from write buffer
    activate SS
    SS->>SE: Get recovered collections
    SE-->>SS: Collection metadata
    SS->>DVS: Load vectors into memtable
    SS-->>Main: Vectors recovered
    deactivate SS
    
    Note over SS,DVS: 🔄 Vector Recovery Complete
    
    Main->>MS: 7. Create MultiServer with SharedServices
    Main->>MS: 8. Start servers
    activate MS
    MS->>MS: Start HTTP on port 5678
    MS->>MS: Start gRPC on port 5679
    MS-->>Main: Servers started
    deactivate MS
    
    Note over Main,MS: 🎉 ProximaDB Ready!